<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('../partials/head') %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/pages.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/age-gate') %>
  <%- include('../partials/header') %>
  <%- include('../partials/cart-drawer') %>

  <main>
    <div class="container pages-hero">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Terms &amp; Conditions</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="pages-hero__lead">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }) %></p>
    </div>

    <div class="container prose-section">
      <p>These terms govern your use of BudBase. This is a demonstration store built for illustrative purposes; this page shows the kind of terms a real Ontario cannabis retailer would publish.</p>

      <h2>Age Requirement &amp; Licensing</h2>
      <p>You must be 19 years of age or older to purchase from BudBase, in line with Ontario's legal minimum age for cannabis. By using this site, you confirm that you meet this requirement. Valid government-issued photo ID is required at delivery.</p>

      <h2>Orders &amp; Payment</h2>
      <p>Orders placed through this site are held as <strong>pending manual processing</strong> until payment is confirmed through the method you select at checkout. We reserve the right to cancel any order where payment cannot be verified.</p>

      <h2>Product Information</h2>
      <p>THC and CBD percentages listed on product pages are approximate ranges. Actual potency may vary by batch.</p>

      <h2>Delivery</h2>
      <p>See our <a href="/shipping-policy">Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy</a> for full details. Delivery times are estimates, not guarantees, and someone 19 or older must be present with valid ID to accept delivery.</p>

      <h2>Refunds &amp; Returns</h2>
      <p>See our <a href="/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a> for full details on when returns are and aren't accepted.</p>

      <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>BudBase is provided "as is" for demonstration purposes. Nothing on this site constitutes medical advice.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms can be sent via our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
  <script src="/js/cart-drawer.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
